WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.231 --> 00:00:02.936
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:05.538
we hope you're doing well.
And now, let's get to the news.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.841
President Biden today
outlined the next phase

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.242
of his administration's
pandemic response,

00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:12.746
and it's tough, but fair.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.582
White House officials
have asked multiple members

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:18.985
of military academy boards
who were appointed

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:21.654
by former President Trump
to resign, including

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.789
former White House
Press Secretary Sean Spicer

00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:25.091
and Kellyanne Conway.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:28.027
Spicer is currently on the board
of the Naval Academy,

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:29.262
and Conway is on the board

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:34.433
of the Academy of the
French Cavalry?

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.903
After Virginia removed
a 21-foot statue

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.505
of Confederate general
Robert E. Lee

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:41.741
from the state capital,
former President Trump

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:45.311
released a statement saying
the U.S. would have succeeded

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:48.247
in Afghanistan
if Lee had been in command.

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:51.184
Dude, he got his ass kicked
in Virginia.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.551
What do you think
the problem was?

00:00:52.551 --> 00:00:54.754
Too many trees?

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:56.956
Former New Jersey governor
Chris Christie spoke tonight

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.091
at the Ronald Reagan Library
about the future

00:00:59.091 --> 00:01:00.326
of the Republican Party.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:03.929
I guess it's always good
to get an outside opinion.

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:06.665
Taliban yesterday announced
a ban on all protests

00:01:06.665 --> 00:01:10.369
and slogans that do not have the
interim government's approval --

00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:14.074
hence Pizza Hut's new slogan
in Afghanistan.

00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:18.544
Donald Trump Jr. claimed
in a recent Instagram post

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:20.846
that former President Trump
"took more crap

00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:23.716
than any other president
times about 1,000."

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:28.354
Wow, 1,000 -- that's more than
four score and seven.

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:31.057
North Korean leader Kim Jong-un
is receiving attention online

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:33.326
after appearing in a military
parade earlier today

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.261
looking noticeably slimmer.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.363
This first reported
in North Korea's

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:40.166
"Help Us Weekly."

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:42.802
In honor of Disney World's
50th anniversary,

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.804
McDonald's has announced
it will release

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:48.474
50 new Happy Meal toys
that feature Disney characters.

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:51.210
50? You're really digging deep.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.979
"I got Mickey!
What did you get?"

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:56.082
"Um, the dead lady from 'Up.'"

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.189
Netflix has announced
that a new season of

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:05.791
"The Great British Baking Show"
will premiere later this month.

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:09.328
"Oh, thank God," said
overscheduled therapists.

00:02:09.328 --> 00:02:11.363
Authorities in Florida
recently arrested a woman

00:02:11.363 --> 00:02:13.499
who allegedly drove a golf cart

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:15.334
through an active
police standoff

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:16.836
while naked and intoxicated --

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:19.071
Which sounds insane,
but, come on -- it's Florida.

00:02:19.071 --> 00:02:20.707
They only caught her
because she crashed into

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:24.110
another naked woman
in a golf cart.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.211
And finally, Mercedes Benz
is set to reveal

00:02:26.211 --> 00:02:31.050
new electric cars next week
at the Munich Auto Show

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.452
as well as a car
that parks itself

00:02:33.452 --> 00:02:35.988
across two handicap spots.

00:02:35.988 --> 00:02:38.258
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

